            0.883,
            0.434
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "on our planet Earth, it has figured out how to do this in a beautiful and carefully balanced way. Ah, but what is time? The clock on the wall or a wrist watch tells us the time and how it passes. We get prepared to go to school in the morning and are ready to sleep at night but have you thought about how we measure time? And how fast does something happen?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
