              "type": "text",
              "content": "not just useful for shadow puppets or to tell the time. Naturally, light helps us see and today, we’ve developed a lot of ways to generate light (so we can read a book at night, even when the Sun doesn’t shine). But, more importantly, asking questions about the nature"
